#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Contacts App</b>: </strong>Record guest identities securely, "
"linking them to their rental orders for\n"
"                compliance and personalized service."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>联系人应用</b>: </strong>安全记录客人身份信息，并将其与租赁订单关"
"联，以满足\n"
"                合规要求并提供个性化服务。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Discuss App</b>: </strong>Facilitate communication between staff "
"members, ensuring that maintenance\n"
"                requests or special guest needs are shared instantly.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>讨论应用</b>: </strong>促进员工之间的沟通，确保维护请求\n"
"                或客人的特殊需求能即时共享。<br/>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Invoicing App</b>: </strong>Simplify billing by generating "
"professional invoices that include room\n"
"                charges, extra services, and automatically computed city "
"taxes."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>发票应用</b>: </strong>生成包含房费、额外服务和自动计算的城市税的"
"专业发票，简化\n"
"                账单处理。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Planning App</b>: </strong>Organize housekeeping and front desk "
"shifts, binding them to rental orders\n"
"                to ensure rooms are ready for new arrivals."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>计划应用</b>: </strong>安排客房清洁和前台班次，并将其与租赁订单绑"
"定，\n"
"                确保客房为新房客准备就绪。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Rental App</b>: </strong>Manage room availability and pricing "
"models, ensuring that every booking is\n"
"                tracked and double-bookings are impossible.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>租赁应用</b>: </strong>管理客房可用性和定价模式，确保每笔预订都\n"
"                被跟踪，且不会出现重复预订。<br/>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website &amp; eCommerce App</b>: </strong>specific your rooms and "
"amenities online, enabling\n"
"                customers to book directly through a professional, mobile-"
"friendly portal.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>网站与电子商务应用</b>: </strong>在线展示您的客房和设施，让\n"
"                客户通过专业且适配移动端的门户直接预订。<br/>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<strong><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">The Grand Norris Palace</span></"
"strong> is a place where <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">luxury meets "
"wilderness</span></b>, where silence becomes a form of poetry, and where "
"every horizon reminds you how vast and beautiful the world can be."
msgstr ""
"<strong><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">The Grand Norris Palace</span></"
"strong>  是一个<b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">奢华与荒野相遇</span></b>的"
"地方：在这里，寂静化作诗意，每一道地平线都提醒您世界何等辽阔而美丽。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Basics</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>基础</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Company specific offers</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>公司专属优惠</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Do you want to go further?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>想要更进一步吗？</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Final word</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>最后说明</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>In such situation, feel free to experiment with this database and "
"then\n"
"                        to create a new one for your own usage.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>在这种情况下，请随意在此数据库中尝试，然后为您自己的使用创建新数据"
"库。</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Multiple resource blocking / period closure</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>多资源封锁 / 期间关闭</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Shared offers</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>共享方案</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Single resource blocking</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>单资源封锁</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Use case</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>使用案例</strong>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"A price at 0 combined with the setting \"Hide Add To Cart\" prevents "
"bookings from your website!"
msgstr "价格为 0 与“隐藏加入购物车”设置结合使用时，会阻止客户从您的网站预订！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:hotel.product_template_12
msgid ""
"A wonderful selection of local products<br>Sweet and salty taste<br>Fresh "
"fruits and vegetables<br>Locally roasted Italian coffee<br>Veggie and vegan "
"available"
msgstr ""
"精选当地优质产品<br>甜咸口味可选<br>新鲜水果和蔬菜<br>本地烘焙的意大利咖啡"
"<br>提供素食和纯素食选择"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Access the rates from the same menu to see how price rules apply during the "
"year."
msgstr "从同一菜单进入价格，查看价格规则在一年中的适用情况。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Access to more details clicking the slot."
msgstr "点击该时段可查看更多详情。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add a line with Dinner Tray or an Airport Shuttle and update the counts as "
"per guest\n"
"                request."
msgstr "根据客人要求添加晚餐托盘或机场接送服务并更新数量。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add here as many of them as needed."
msgstr "根据需要在此添加任意数量。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add some products to the ongoing order and send it to the preparation "
"display and bring them to your guests."
msgstr "将一些产品添加到当前订单，发送到备餐显示屏，然后端给您的客人。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust the number of stars, leave a comment and send it!"
msgstr "调整星级评分，留下评论并发送！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Adjust the rental dates, click the book button and then proceed to checkout."
msgstr "调整租赁日期，点击预订按钮，然后进行结算。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust your prices along the year"
msgstr "全年灵活调整价格"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjusting your offers in consequence"
msgstr "据此调整您的方案"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Again, the <strong>Hotel App </strong>helps you manage the end of the stay!"
msgstr "同样，<strong>酒店应用</strong>帮助您管理住宿结束事宜！"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_17
msgid "Airport Shuttle"
msgstr "机场接送服务"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.products_oe_structure_website_sale_products_1
msgid "All our rooms"
msgstr "我们所有的客房"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternativelly, you can use the Front Desk from the POS App, selecting the\n"
"                    customer, adding any additional services and then paying "
"with the customer\n"
"                    account. At the end of the stay the customer account "
"will be charged as well."
msgstr ""
"或者，您可以使用 POS 应用中的前台功能，选择客户、添加任何额外服务，然后通过客"
"户账户付款。在住宿结束时，客户账户也将被扣款。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively to individual resource blocking slots described earlier, you "
"can select a resource this leave applies to."
msgstr ""
"除了前面介绍的单个资源封锁时段之外，您也可以选择一个资源，让此休假对其生效。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, and then change the resource.<br/"
">Be\n"
"                    careful not to double book a resource with such change!"
msgstr ""
"或者，切换到列表视图，然后更改资源。<br/>请注意\n"
"                    此类更改不要重复预订资源！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, which is more suitable if the "
"booking is\n"
"                    not during the visualized date range and update the "
"booking date range."
msgstr ""
"或者，切换到列表视图，如果预订不在可视日期范围内，这种方式更合适，然后更新预"
"订日期范围。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type in the search bar and select the appropriate filter."
msgstr "或者，在搜索栏中输入并选择适当的筛选条件。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can create a slot as placeholder from the planning "
"directly:"
msgstr "或者，您也可以直接从计划中创建一个占位时段："

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Anyone can create a portal account on your database.<br/>Open your website "
"home page\n"
"                in a private tab to do so."
msgstr ""
"任何人都可以在您的数据库上创建门户账户。<br/>在隐私标签页中打开您的网站主页即"
"可操作。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Assign them a resource, which helps you keeping track."
msgstr "为他们分配资源，便于您跟踪。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time during their stay, open their rental order from the Hotel App."
msgstr "在客人住宿期间的任何时间，从酒店应用打开他们的租赁订单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time from the guest order, use the Send message capability in the "
"chatter\n"
"                    to exchange with your guest."
msgstr "在客人订单中的任何时间，使用聊天功能中的发送消息功能与客人交流。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time you can adjust the city tax count delivered by re-opening the "
"city tax widget clicking the City Tax button on the guest order."
msgstr ""
"您可以随时在客人订单上点击“城市税”按钮，重新打开城市税小工具来调整计算出的城"
"市税。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "At the end of their stay, your guests will pay for all those extras."
msgstr "在住宿结束时，您的客人将支付所有这些额外费用。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Bar &amp; Restaurant and extra services"
msgstr "酒吧与餐厅及额外服务"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Because keeping an eye on your business performance matters, the module "
"comes with a dedicated dashboard."
msgstr "关注业务表现至关重要，因此该模块自带专用的仪表板。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Beyond daily operations, the Steering menu serves as the \"Captain’s "
"Bridge\" of your hotel. It provides a 500-day horizon to anticipate market "
"trends, manage risks, and optimize your revenue."
msgstr ""
"除了日常运营之外，“掌舵”菜单就是您酒店的“船长驾驶台”。它提供 500 天的视野，帮"
"助您预判市场趋势、管理风险并优化收入。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Blocking resources"
msgstr "封锁资源"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Booking a room"
msgstr "预订房间"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_12
msgid "Breakfast"
msgstr "早餐"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_14
msgid "Breakfast Tray"
msgstr "早餐托盘"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Odoo 会根据您所在的位置将税项和应税设定导入您的数据库。这些内容已"
"预先配置好，方便您对外销售；但如果您需要对外国客户也适用本地税率，可能还需要"
"做少量配置。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products,\n"
"            sale orders and more."
msgstr "通过上传此模块的演示数据，您的数据库已填充了一些产品、销售订单等。"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_16
msgid "Champagne Bottle"
msgstr "香槟瓶"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "向客人收费"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Chat with us or fill in this form to get information about anything related "
"to our rooms or the palace.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"与我们在线聊天，或填写此表单，了解有关我们客房或宫殿的任何信息。<br/><br/>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guest who stayed in each room. Then "
"confirm the number of city tax to be charged, which updated the delivered "
"city tax count."
msgstr ""
"请检查并根据需要调整每间客房的入住客人数量。随后确认应收取的城市税金额，这将"
"更新已提交的城市税计数。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "办理客人入住"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "办理客人退房"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check information and then confirm the booking."
msgstr "核对信息并确认预订。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"实践中，城市税按实际入住的晚数而非理论晚数计费，并按每位客人入住晚数的总和计"
"算。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the room to book."
msgstr "点击任意房间进行预订。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr "点击“入住”按钮确认客人现已入住！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr "点击“退房”按钮记录客人归还钥匙。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "点击“创建订单”打开订单表单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Pay with demo button, and then Pay button to mimic the payment."
msgstr "点击“演示支付”按钮，然后点击“支付”按钮模拟支付过程。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Settle PoS Orders button to add the corresponding order lines."
msgstr "点击“结算 POS 订单”按钮以添加相应的订单行。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the tail of the corresponding booking and drag it to the requested "
"date."
msgstr "点击相应预订的尾部并将其拖拽到要求的日期。"

#. module: hotel
#: model:website.page,name:hotel.page_contactus
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.template_footer_minimalist
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_contactus
msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave selecting the appropriate working schedule, the one from "
"your stay resources."
msgstr "新建休假时，选择合适的工作时间表，即您住宿资源所使用的那一个。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave the same way as previously, but this time specify the "
"resource this applies to."
msgstr "按之前的方式新建休假，但这次请指定该休假适用的资源。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Created offers are assigned no company nor branch (default behavior).<br/>As "
"a result, they are available from all companies and branches, as well as all "
"websites from those."
msgstr ""
"创建的方案未分配任何公司或分支机构（默认行为）。<br/>因此，它们可用于所有公司"
"和分支机构，以及这些公司名下的所有网站。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Define start and end date time and save your leave."
msgstr "定义开始和结束日期时间，然后保存您的休假。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Deliver extra services"
msgstr "提供额外服务"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_15
msgid "Dinner Tray"
msgstr "晚餐托盘"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "深入了解 Odoo 的更多功能"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Discover the basics of this package and explore all the possibilities Odoo "
"offers to\n"
"            improve your experience."
msgstr "了解此套餐的基础知识，探索 Odoo 为提升您体验所提供的所有可能性。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't be limited to those examples, you could have a gym area available to "
"members or a spa with massages!"
msgstr "不必局限于这些示例，您还可以为会员提供健身区，或提供带按摩的水疗服务！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to add resources available for payment at checkout from the POS "
"payment methods.<br/>Beware this is not possible when a POS session is open."
msgstr ""
"别忘了在 POS 付款方式中，为结账时可支付的资源进行设置。<br/>请注意，当 POS 会"
"话处于打开状态时无法进行此操作。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to replicate the Booking Blocker rule on all your pricelists "
"and to specify the website this applies to.<br/>On a regular basis postpone "
"this booking blocker start date season after season to unlock your calendar."
msgstr ""
"别忘了在所有价格表中复制“预订阻止”规则，并指定其适用的网站。<br/>请定期在每个"
"季节之后推迟该预订阻止的开始日期，以解锁您的日历。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Don't forget to send them their invoice!"
msgstr "别忘了给他们发送发票！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Duplicate the sales tax that applies to your stay offer and rename the "
"duplicate to indicate that it applies locally, e.g. 15% (stay)."
msgstr ""
"复制适用于您住宿产品的销售税，并重命名副本以标明其仅适用于本地，例如 15%（住"
"宿）。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"During an available period, click, drag and drop on a room line to create a "
"slot."
msgstr "在可用期间，点击、拖拽到房间行上以创建时间段。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Each company can have its own website!"
msgstr "每家公司都可以拥有自己的网站！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Each stone was carved from the surrounding cliffs, each beam of larch wood "
"carried up the slopes by mule. The architecture blended <b><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Belle Époque elegance</span></b> with <b><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">mountain authenticity</span></b>, creating an "
"atmosphere that felt both majestic and deeply intimate."
msgstr ""
"每一块石头都取自周围的崖壁，每一根落叶松木梁都由骡子运上山坡。建筑将 "
"<b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">美好年代的优雅</span></b> 与 <b><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">山地的质朴本色</span></b> 融为一体，营造出既宏伟又格"
"外亲切的氛围。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Employee assignations"
msgstr "员工分配"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Employee would open the tasks from their portal access and update the task "
"stage."
msgstr "员工可以通过门户访问打开任务，并更新任务阶段。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid "End date"
msgstr "终止日期"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Enforce local tax rate"
msgstr "强制适用本地税率"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Example: A room for 2 is booked for 4 nights, two guests were here for the "
"first three nights but only one stayed the last night. Then the guests x "
"nights is 2x3+1x1=7."
msgstr ""
"示例：一间 2 人客房预订 4 晚，前 3 晚有两位客人入住，最后一晚只有一位客人入"
"住。那么客人数 × 晚数为 2x3+1x1=7。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.template_footer_minimalist
msgid "Follow us"
msgstr "跟随我们"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_11
msgid "Free Cancellation"
msgstr "免费取消"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the <strong>Hotel App</strong>, you can manage your bookings.<br/>The\n"
"            Hotel App relies on the Rental and Planning Apps binding, with a "
"few\n"
"            customizations."
msgstr ""
"通过 <strong>酒店应用程序</strong>，您可以管理您的预订。<br/>\n"
"            酒店应用基于租赁和计划应用的绑定，并进行了\n"
"            一些定制。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the Roles sections, you can select the companies and branches this "
"employee shall have access to as well as the default one."
msgstr "在角色配置板块，可勾选该员工有权访问的公司与分支机构，并设置默认主体。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the search bar select the Today filter to see to check in and to check "
"out\n"
"                orders."
msgstr ""
"在搜索栏中选择“今天”筛选器，即可查看待入住和待退房的\n"
"                订单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "From there you can add new companies."
msgstr "在那里您可以添加新公司。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Guided by this vision, Norris chose a secluded plateau overlooking a "
"pristine valley, where the silence of the pines mingled with the distant "
"echo of cowbells. There, with the help of local craftsmen and artisans, he "
"began to build what would become the <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Grand "
"Norris Palace</span></b>."
msgstr ""
"在这一愿景的指引下，Norris 选择了一处俯瞰原始山谷的幽静高地，松林的寂静与远处"
"牛铃的回响交织在一起。在那里，他借助当地工匠和手艺人的帮助，开始建造后来的 "
"<b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Grand Norris Palace</span></b>."

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "您好！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Here you can monitor past and future performance in the books, with overall "
"occupancy, average daily rate, revenue per available room and pickups!"
msgstr ""
"在这里您可以查看账面上过去和未来的业绩，包括整体入住率、平均每日房价、每间可"
"售房收入和预订增量！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Here, nature reigns supreme. Mornings begin with the scent of larch and the "
"sound of distant waterfalls; evenings end under a canopy of stars untouched "
"by city lights. The Palace's terraces open onto sweeping views of the <span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>Mont Blanc massif</b></span> and the <b><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Trient Glacier</span></b>, offering a sense of "
"peace that feels almost sacred."
msgstr ""
"在这里，大自然主宰一切。清晨始于落叶松的芬芳和远处瀑布的水声；夜晚在不为城市"
"灯光所扰的星空下落幕。宫殿的露台可远眺 <span class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>勃朗"
"峰群峰</b></span> 和 <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">特里安冰川</span></"
"b>，带来一种近乎神圣的宁静。"

#. module: hotel
#: model:website.page,name:hotel.page_home
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.template_footer_minimalist
msgid "Home"
msgstr "首页"

#. module: hotel
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.res_config_settings_form_view_inherited
msgid "Hotel"
msgstr "酒店"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If not OK, then click the contact, fill in the Identity section and save "
"the\n"
"                contact."
msgstr ""
"若信息不完整，请点击联系人，填写身份信息部分并保存\n"
"                联系人。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If they paid orders at any point of sale with their customer account, their "
"customer account due amount will be displayed as well as a button for you to "
"settle the associated orders."
msgstr ""
"如果他们在任意销售点使用客户账户支付了订单，系统会显示该客户账户的欠款金额，"
"以及一个用于结算相关订单的按钮。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If using the house keeping approver setting, designated\n"
"                    approvers can check each room and set their state to "
"ready to close the tasks."
msgstr ""
"若使用日常维护审批人设置，指定的\n"
"                    审批人可检查每个房间，并将状态设为已准备就绪以关闭任务。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to execute a practical guided tour of this module, you should "
"Import\n"
"                    demo data and try the Demo - Use Case (In the next "
"Knowledge Article)"
msgstr ""
"如果想执行此模块的实际操作导览，您应该导入\n"
"                    模拟资料，然后试试使用 “演示 - 使用例子”（详见下一篇知识"
"库文章）。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "In any case, the resources are company and branch dependent."
msgstr "无论如何，资源都取决于公司和分支机构。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In any case, you may have written records in journals which are not delete-"
"able and which\n"
"            might be an issue for your traceability."
msgstr ""
"无论如何，日记账中可能存在无法删除的已写记录，\n"
"            这可能会影响您的可追溯性。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In case you outsource or rely more heavily on suppliers, the "
"<strong>Purchase App</strong>\n"
"                will help you to manage those aspects."
msgstr ""
"如果您外包业务或更依赖供应商，<strong>采购应用</strong>\n"
"                将帮助您管理这些方面。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"It enables each place manager to adjust the stay offers with greater "
"flexibility without impacting other places."
msgstr "它让每个营业场所的经理都能更灵活地调整住宿产品，而不影响其他场所。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Keep your guests satisfied"
msgstr "让您的客人满意"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_8
msgid "La Claudia"
msgstr "La Claudia"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:hotel.product_template_8
msgid ""
"La Claudia invites you into a bright and contemporary environment, where "
"soft colors and chic furnishings enhance your sense of well-being. Whether "
"you are unwinding after an active day or enjoying a quiet morning with a "
"view, this room brings together elegance, space, and serenity for an "
"unforgettable stay."
msgstr ""
"La Claudia 邀您步入明亮而现代的空间，柔和的色彩与时尚的家具提升您的舒适感。无"
"论是在活动一天后放松身心，还是在宁静的清晨欣赏美景，这间客房都将优雅、宽敞与"
"宁静融为一体，为您带来难忘的住宿体验。"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_9
msgid "La Maria"
msgstr "La Maria"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:hotel.product_template_9
msgid ""
"La Maria welcomes you with a bright and refined atmosphere, blending modern "
"comfort with subtle alpine charm. Soft textures, elegant furnishings, and "
"thoughtfully designed spaces create the ideal setting to relax and recharge. "
"With its soothing ambiance and premium amenities, La Maria offers a serene "
"escape in the heart of the Swiss Alps."
msgstr ""
"La Maria 以明亮精致的氛围迎接您，将现代舒适与淡淡的高山魅力融为一体。柔软的织"
"物、优雅的家具和精心设计的空间，营造出放松身心、恢复活力的理想环境。凭借舒缓"
"的氛围和高品质的设施，La Maria 在瑞士阿尔卑斯山腹地为您提供一处宁静的避世之"
"所。"

#. module: hotel
#: model:product.template,name:hotel.product_template_10
msgid "La Nina"
msgstr "La Nina"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:hotel.product_template_10
msgid ""
"La Nina is a sophisticated haven combining contemporary elegance with the "
"charm of alpine living. Its thoughtfully curated decor, premium bedding, and "
"high-end comforts create a serene environment for true rest. Enjoy the "
"mountain view from your private space, indulge in a moment of calm, and "
"experience a stay where every detail is designed for your well-being."
msgstr ""
"La Nina 是一处精致的避风港，将现代优雅与高山生活的魅力融为一体。精心布置的装"
"饰、优质床品和高端的舒适配置，营造出真正放松的宁静环境。在您的私人空间里欣赏"
"山景，享受片刻宁静，体验每一个细节都为您的舒适而设计的住宿。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Lastly, replace the tax applied to your stay offers with this new tax."
msgstr "最后，将应用于住宿产品的税项替换为这个新税项。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Leaving a review"
msgstr "留下评价"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Let's book a room!"
msgstr "来预订一间客房吧！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your accounting easier than ever with a completely integrated "
"environment i<font class=\"text-o-color-5\">n </font><strong>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">Accounting App</font>\n"
"                </strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
"在完全集成的环境<font class=\"text-o-color-5\">中</font>，<strong>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">会计应用</font>\n"
"                </strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">让会计管理比以往更轻"
"松。</font>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing scarcity with availability"
msgstr "通过可用性管理稀缺"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing your businesses"
msgstr "管理您的业务"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Monitoring performance"
msgstr "监控业绩"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Monitoring success with occupancy"
msgstr "通过入住率监控经营成果"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that they relax, you can offer extra services to make your guests feel "
"even more\n"
"            comfortable!"
msgstr ""
"客人放松之后，您可以提供额外服务，让他们的住宿体验更加\n"
"            舒适！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that you have several companies or branches, you may want some of your "
"employees to access only to some of them in case they always work in some of "
"your places."
msgstr ""
"既然您有多个公司或分支机构，如果某些员工始终在特定场所工作，您可能希望他们只"
"能访问其中一部分。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo 为您提供无限可能，例如："

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free\n"
"            to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test everything "
"around!"
msgstr ""
"当然，这只是此软件套装所涵盖功能的概述\n"
"            您可随意加入新的应用程序、删除或修改模拟资料，并在不同介面尽情测"
"试！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On a daily basis, house keeping tasks are created depending on the current "
"stays and assigned to employees that have house keeping shifts."
msgstr "每天会根据当前住宿情况创建客房清洁任务，并分配给有客房清洁班次的员工。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "On a resource to block line, click, drag and drop to create a slot."
msgstr "在要封锁的资源行上，点击并拖放即可创建一个时段。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "On top of guest and stay management, you need to keep the place clean!"
msgstr "除了管理客人和住宿之外，您还需要保持场所清洁！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once confirmed, the payment is done and the order booked seamlessly!"
msgstr "确认后，付款即完成，订单也顺利预订成功！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once defined, you can switch between companies or branches from the company "
"selector at the top right of your screen.<br/>This will expose depending on "
"where you are, only the selected companies and branches data."
msgstr ""
"定义完成后，您可以通过屏幕右上角的公司选择器在公司或分支机构之间切换。<br/>这"
"样系统只会显示您所在位置所选公司和分支机构的数据。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once done adding all the necessary rooms, click on a recently added slot and "
"then\n"
"                click the rental order link."
msgstr ""
"添加完所有必要的客房后，点击最近添加的时段，然后\n"
"                点击租赁订单链接。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once done, let's click, drag and drop on another room line to create a slot."
msgstr "完成后，我们在另一条客房行上点击并拖放，创建一个时段。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once done, logged in as a portal user."
msgstr "完成后，以门户用户身份登录。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once your guest order is all set after check out, create an invoice from "
"their order."
msgstr "客人退房后，当客人订单全部处理完毕，即可根据该订单创建发票。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open a room page from the website and scroll down to the Customer Reviews "
"section."
msgstr "在网站上打开某个客房页面，向下滚动到“客户评价”部分。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open now, the Tasks from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>This "
"is\n"
"                the daily list of house keeping tasks to be tackled."
msgstr ""
"现在打开酒店应用的“任务”，进入“客房清洁”菜单。<br/>这是\n"
"                需要处理的每日客房清洁任务清单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the companies from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr "打开 <strong>设置应用</strong>，从“用户与公司”菜单进入公司。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the users from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr "打开 <strong>设置应用</strong>，从“用户与公司”菜单进入用户。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the <strong>Website App</strong> and navigate to the Rooms."
msgstr "打开 <strong>网站应用</strong>，导航到客房。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Board from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>Here you "
"have an\n"
"                overview of the cleanness state of your resources."
msgstr ""
"打开酒店应用的“看板”，进入“客房清洁”菜单。<br/>在这里您可以\n"
"                总览各资源的清洁状态。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Default pricelist from the configuration menu."
msgstr "从配置菜单中打开默认价格表。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Default pricelist to see the existing price rules which apply to it."
msgstr "打开默认价格表，查看适用于它的现有价格规则。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Hotel App and navigate to the Configuration / Leaves menu."
msgstr "打开酒店应用，进入“配置 / 休假”菜单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Hotel App and then navigate to the orders from the menu."
msgstr "打开酒店应用，然后从菜单进入订单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Hotel App to appreciate the currently planned bookings with the\n"
"                Schedule."
msgstr ""
"打开酒店应用，通过\n"
"                日程表查看当前已计划的预订。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the POS App and select one of the register, the Bar for example."
msgstr "打开 POS 应用，选择其中一个收银台，例如酒吧。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Planning from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>\n"
"                There you can create shifts for house keeping duties and "
"assign employees."
msgstr ""
"打开酒店应用的“计划”，进入“客房清洁”菜单。<br/>\n"
"                在那里您可以为客房清洁工作创建班次并分配员工。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Pricelists from the <strong>Hotel App</strong>, Configuration / "
"Pricelists menu."
msgstr "从 <strong>酒店应用</strong> 打开价格表，路径为“配置 / 价格表”菜单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Availability."
msgstr "打开“掌舵”菜单，选择可用性。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Occupancy."
msgstr "打开“掌舵”菜单，选择入住率。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Survey App to find the customer satisfaction survey."
msgstr "打开调查应用，找到客户满意度调查。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Taxes from the <strong>Invoicing App</strong>, under the "
"Configuration / Accounting menu."
msgstr "从 <strong>发票应用</strong> 打开税项，位于“配置 / 会计”菜单下。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the door for more custom workflows and actions with the power of "
"<strong>Studio\n"
"                App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"利用 Studio 的强大功能，打开自定义更多工作流程及操作的大门：尽在 "
"<strong>Studio\n"
"                应用程序</strong>。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the order of you just arrived guests."
msgstr "打开您刚刚抵达客人的订单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open your guest order from the Hotel App."
msgstr "从酒店应用打开您的客人订单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Organize your employees' schedules with<font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> "
"<strong>\n"
"                Planning</strong></font><strong>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> App</font>\n"
"                </strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
"使用<font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> <strong>\n"
"                排期</strong></font><strong>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> 应用</font>\n"
"                </strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">来组织您员工的工作日"
"程。</font>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Our team will be delighted to assist you and will respond to your message "
"within 2 open&amp;nbsp;days"
msgstr "我们的团队很乐意为您提供帮助，并将在 2 个工作日内回复您的留言。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Perched high above the valley of <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Orsières</"
"span></b>, in the enchanting <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Valais "
"region</span></b> of Switzerland, the <b><span class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Grand Norris Palace</span></b> enjoys one of the most breathtaking "
"settings in the Alps.&amp;nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"高踞于 <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">奥西耶尔</span></b> 山谷之上，坐落在"
"瑞士迷人的 <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">瓦莱州</span></b>，<b><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Grand Norris Palace</span></b> 拥有阿尔卑斯山最令人"
"屏息的环境之一。&amp;nbsp;"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Prevent bookings year in advance"
msgstr "提前一年阻止预订"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Proceed to the payment with your terminal and set the invoice as paid."
msgstr "使用您的终端进行付款，并将发票标记为已付款。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Record guest identity"
msgstr "记录客人身份"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Recording the guest attendance is an obligation in numerous countries."
msgstr "在许多国家，记录客人入住信息是强制要求。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.template_footer_minimalist
msgid "Rooms"
msgstr "房间"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Save the order with those extra services."
msgstr "保存包含这些额外服务的订单。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"See that for demo purpose we setup typical uplift and discount rules to "
"adjust your prices during key periods."
msgstr ""
"可以看到，出于演示目的，我们设置了一些典型的加价和折扣规则，用于在关键时段调"
"整价格。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "See that it contains a rule booking blocker setting price to 0."
msgstr "可以看到其中包含一条预订阻止规则，将价格设为 0。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select one of your employee."
msgstr "选择您的一位员工。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select or create a customer and then confirm the booking!"
msgstr "选择或创建客户，然后确认预订！"

#. module: hotel
#: model:pos.category,name:hotel.pos_category_1
msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Setup company or branch specific offers when relevant."
msgstr "在需要时设置特定于公司或分支机构的方案。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share your stay offers across your companies and branches (default behavior);"
msgstr "在您的公司和分支机构之间共享住宿产品（默认行为）；"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Simply open the Dashboard App to land on the Performance dashboard."
msgstr "只需打开仪表板应用，即可进入“业绩”仪表板。"

#. module: hotel
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:hotel.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "软依赖"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid "Start date"
msgstr "开始日期"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Still from the Hotel App Schedule, simply drag and drop a booking to "
"another\n"
"                more comfortable room!"
msgstr ""
"依旧在酒店预订日程界面，直接拖拽预订订单，\n"
"                即可更换至其他更舒适的客房！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Still from their Rental Order, open the Guests tab."
msgstr "仍在租赁订单页面，打开宾客信息标签页。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_contactus
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "提交"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Surrounded by <span class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>snow-capped peaks, pine "
"forests, and crystal-clear mountain lakes</b>,</span> the Palace overlooks a "
"panorama that changes with every season <em>from the golden glow of autumn "
"to the soft, shimmering silence of winter.</em>"
msgstr ""
"四周环绕着 <span class=\"text-o-color-1\"><b>白雪皑皑的群峰、松林和清澈见底的"
"高山湖泊</b>，</span> 宫殿俯瞰着随季节变换的全景：<em>从秋日的金色光辉到冬日"
"柔和而晶莹的寂静。</em>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the availability for you to "
"work on filling in."
msgstr "甘特图用颜色标示可用性，方便您着手填补空档。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the occupancy, the higher the "
"better."
msgstr "甘特图用颜色标示入住率，越高越好。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Occupancy view allows you to visualize your \"Sales Success\". It "
"answers one simple question: <i>How well am I filling my hotel?</i>"
msgstr ""
"入住率视图让您直观看到自己的“销售成果”。它回答一个简单的问题： <i>我的酒店住"
"得有多满？</i>"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"The estate lies at the crossroads of ancient mountain paths once used by "
"shepherds and traders crossing into Italy. Today, it remains a place of "
"quiet majesty, far from the noise of the world yet easily accessible from "
"<b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Verbier, Montreux, or Geneva</span></b>. "
"Guests arrive along a winding alpine road that reveals, turn after turn, a "
"landscape of pure wonder — until, at last, the turrets of the Grand Norris "
"Palace emerge against the sky."
msgstr ""
"这座庄园坐落在古老山路的交汇处，这些山路曾是牧羊人和商人通往意大利的必经之"
"路。如今，它依然是一处静谧而庄严的地方，远离尘世的喧嚣，却又能从 <b><span "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">韦尔比耶、蒙特勒或日内瓦</span></b> 轻松抵达。客人沿"
"着蜿蜒的高山公路前行，一个弯道接着一个弯道，展现出纯粹而奇妙的风景——直到最"
"后，Grand Norris Palace 的塔楼在天际浮现。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.view_page_home
msgid ""
"The story begins in <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">1897</span></b>, when "
"visionary hotelier <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Edmond Norris</span></"
"b> , captivated by the untouched majesty of the Valais mountains, dreamt of "
"creating a sanctuary unlike any other — a place where the rugged purity of "
"the Alps would meet the grace and refinement of European hospitality."
msgstr ""
"故事始于 <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">1897 年</span></b>，富有远见的酒店"
"经营者 <b><span class=\"text-o-color-1\">Edmond Norris</span></b> 被瓦莱州群"
"山未经雕琢的壮美所吸引，梦想建造一处与众不同的世外桃源——一个让阿尔卑斯山的粗"
"犷纯粹与欧洲待客之道的优雅精致相遇的地方。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The strength of Odoo is to separate the accounting and many other aspects "
"which are company dependent!"
msgstr "Odoo 的优势在于将会计以及其他许多与公司相关的方面分离开来！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The tasks are assigned to balance cleaning points from the stay offers "
"within employees assigned to the associated house keeping role."
msgstr ""
"任务会分配给担任相应客房清洁角色的员工，以平衡各住宿产品之间的清洁点数。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then empty the fiscal position so that the tax applies regardless of your "
"customer's fiscal position."
msgstr "然后将应税设定留空，这样无论客户的应税设定如何，该税项都会适用。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr "这些都是您当前订阅中的免费内容；请随意浏览！🙃"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"They as well share the same pricing, defined at the stay offer level, which "
"has its pros and cons."
msgstr "它们也共享相同的定价，该定价在住宿产品层级定义，这既有优点也有缺点。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "They want multiple rooms?"
msgstr "他们想要多个房间？"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "They were happy about their stay, let's ask them to leave a review."
msgstr "客人对住宿体验十分满意，邀请他们留下评价。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This blocks simulataneously all resources related to this working schedule "
"during the prescribed period."
msgstr "这会在指定期间内同时封锁与该工作时间表相关的所有资源。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "This capability is enabled by a setting you can set/unset."
msgstr "此功能通过一个可开启/关闭的设置来启用。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This configuration step may be required to avoid any tax collection "
"inconsistency."
msgstr "为避免任何税款征收不一致，可能需要执行此配置步骤。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup can be used for all products that must keep local tax rates (e.g. "
"late check-in)."
msgstr "此设置可用于所有必须保留本地税率的产品（例如延迟入住）。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup is relevant in case of place specific offers or when pricing "
"varies between places."
msgstr "当存在针对特定场所的方案，或不同场所定价不同时，此设置就很有用。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time click the Add to last order button to add this room to the booking "
"and\n"
"                voila!"
msgstr ""
"这次点击“添加到最后一笔订单”按钮，将这间客房加入预订，\n"
"                就这么简单！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time, simply leave a note about the why this is booked and save the "
"slot."
msgstr "这次只需备注预订原因，然后保存该时段。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Trace guest attendance"
msgstr "追踪客人入住"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Two options are now available to you with multiple companies and branches:"
msgstr "有了多个公司和分支机构后，您现在有两种选择："

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Type in the customer name in the Schedule search bar filtering by Customer."
msgstr "在时间表的搜寻列，输入客户名称，并选择依据客户筛选。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Welcome your guests as well from the <strong>Hotel App</strong>."
msgstr "也可以从 <strong>酒店应用</strong> 迎接您的客人。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "When all is in order, confirm their invoice for payment."
msgstr "一切就绪后，确认他们的发票以待付款。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When creating an offer, assign them a company or a branch.<br/>As a result, "
"they are available only for the selected company or branch, and will be "
"available only from its website."
msgstr ""
"创建优惠活动时，需为其分配所属公司或分支机构。<br/>完成分配后，该优惠仅对所选"
"公司 / 分支机构生效，且仅会在其对应的网站页面展示。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When they ask for the bill, you can charge them directly or add the bill to "
"their order associating their stay resource.<br/>To do so, open the "
"corresponding order from the table or from the order list and select the "
"customer to charge.<br/>Select the Checkout Payment method and validate to "
"close the POS order and capture this expense on customer order; which you "
"can charge them for during the check out."
msgstr ""
"当客人要求结账时，您可以直接收款，或将该账单关联到他们的住宿资源并加入其订"
"单。<br/>为此，请从餐桌或订单列表中打开相应订单，并选择要收费的客户。<br/>选"
"择“结账”付款方式并确认，即可关闭 POS 订单并把这笔费用记入客户订单；您可以在退"
"房时向其收取。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While Occupancy focuses on what is full, the Availability view focuses on "
"what is left to sell. It is your primary tool for operational safety and "
"\"Scarcity Pricing.\""
msgstr ""
"入住率关注的是已经住满的部分，而可用性视图关注的则是还剩多少可售。它是您保障"
"运营安全和实施“稀缺定价”的主要工具。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Willing to upgrade a booking?"
msgstr "是否愿意升级预订？"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With the create slot for this resource, no overlapping booking slot would be "
"created.<br/>Care about the start and end time or this blockage to make to "
"re-open when suited."
msgstr ""
"使用为该资源创建的时段时，不会创建重叠的预订时段。<br/>请注意开始和结束时间，"
"或在需要时重新开放该封锁。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "您希望与我们讨论您当前的 Odoo 配置方案，还是寻求更进一步的合作？"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "You Hotel is online and future guests found it!"
msgstr "您的酒店已上线，未来的客人已经找到了它！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You are repairing a room or simply welcoming family and don't want guests to "
"book it?<br/>Alternatively, you are closing for a week during an inter "
"season break?<br/>Let's have this reflected in your schedule!"
msgstr ""
"您正在修缮某间客房，或只是想接待家人，不希望客人预订它？<br/>或者，您要在淡季"
"期间歇业一周？<br/>让我们把这种情况反映到日程中吧！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "您可以在主仪表板上访问 Odoo 数据库中每个已安装的应用程序。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can as well select your company and in the Branches tab define branches."
msgstr "您也可以选择您的公司，并在“分支机构”选项卡中定义分支机构。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can create an alternative customer satisfaction survey and select it "
"from the Automated Survey settings, as well as configure the email delay as "
"you wish the email to be sent after the guest checkout."
msgstr ""
"您可以创建另一个客户满意度调查，并在“自动调查”设置中选择它，还可以配置邮件延"
"迟时间，让邮件在客人退房后按您希望的时间发送。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your\n"
"                    Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"您已完成了该演示用例！还有无数种方法可以调整你的 Odoo 设置，以满足您的业务需"
"求。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You could customize this section to add the identity document picture or "
"extra\n"
"                    fields at your convenience with studio. Just be careful, "
"such customizations can\n"
"                    quickly become messy."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 Studio 自定义此部分，按需添加身份证件图片或额外\n"
"                    字段。但请注意，此类自定义可能\n"
"                    很快就会变得杂乱。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt;\n"
"                    Upgrade your package and check the related box"
msgstr ""
"您没有导入演示数据？仍然可以导入。前往“应用 &gt; 行业 &gt;\n"
"                    升级您的套餐”，并勾选相关复选框"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "You have a future guest on the line willing to book a room?"
msgstr "有未来的客人正在电话中，想要预订一间客房？"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You have an hotel but may be providing numerous peripheral services and "
"offers.<br/>Here\n"
"            is how you might centralize those and bind them to your "
"customers in a single database."
msgstr ""
"您经营着一家酒店，但可能还提供许多周边服务和方案。<br/>\n"
"            下面介绍如何将它们集中管理，并在同一个数据库中与您的客户关联。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You just installed the Odoo for Hotel package. By doing so, we have "
"installed a\n"
"            bunch of necessary apps to run your Hotel efficiently."
msgstr ""
"您刚刚安装了 Odoo 酒店行业包。安装后，我们已为您安装了一系列\n"
"            运行酒店所需的应用，帮助您高效经营。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may be running multiple places at the same time and most likely be "
"willing to run them all from the same database.<b/>We got you covered with "
"this using multiple companies or branches!"
msgstr ""
"您可能同时在经营多个场所，并且很可能希望全部使用同一个数据库。<b/>我们通过多"
"公司或多分支机构功能为您解决了这个问题！"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may want to uplift your margin during high season and be attractive "
"during low one playing on price.<br/>To do so, let's define price rules."
msgstr ""
"您可能希望在旺季提高利润率，并在淡季以价格吸引客人。<br/>为此，我们来定义价格"
"规则。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "You might have tested this package with or without demo data."
msgstr "您可能已经在有或没有演示数据的情况下测试过此行业包。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You noticed that the Identity Check highlights whether you captured all the\n"
"            necessary information for a guest?"
msgstr ""
"您注意到“身份核验”会提示您是否已采集客人所需的全部\n"
"            信息了吗？"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You now know how to create a new order.<br/>Let's replicate the previous "
"steps but\n"
"                this time, without confirming the order (just saving it as "
"draft)."
msgstr ""
"现在您已经知道如何创建新订单。<br/>让我们重复前面的步骤，但\n"
"                这次不确认订单（只将其保存为草稿）。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various flows\n"
"            you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"您可以执行以下流程，概览使用 Odoo 通过此行业包\n"
"            可以快速完成的各种流程。"

#. module: hotel
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hotel.welcome_article_body
msgid "You welcome your first guests, awesome!"
msgstr "您迎来了第一批客人，太棒了！"

